0.855 0.863 0.878 RG 72 709 m 540 709 l S
BT /F2 16 Tf 72 691 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj ET
0.180 0.455 0.710 RG 72 669 m 540 669 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 657 Td (J&J's Kitchenette is a PHP and MySQL-based online ordering system for a food business. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 643 Td (application supports customer browsing, account registration, cart checkout, delivery or store) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 629 Td (pickup ordering, admin product management, order processing, reporting, staff permissions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 615 Td (password resets, and email notifications.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 598 Td (The production deployment uses a Dockerized PHP 8.3 Apache runtime on Render, a remote MySQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 584 Td (database on Aiven, and Brevo API email delivery. The current Render Blueprint is named jj-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 570 Td (kitchenette-dem9 and is configured for the Singapore region.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 72 547 Td (2. Project Objectives) Tj ET
0.180 0.455 0.710 RG 72 525 m 540 525 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 513 Td (- Provide a customer-facing storefront where users can view menu items, product details,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 499 Td (  pricing, and recommendations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 485 Td (- Allow registered customers to manage profiles, saved addresses, carts, orders, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 471 Td (  checkout details.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 457 Td (- Provide admins and authorized staff with inventory, product, order, category, customer,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 443 Td (  report, and settings management.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 429 Td (- Support order confirmation and status update emails using an API-based mail provider) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 415 Td (  suitable for Render hosting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 401 Td (- Deploy reliably to a cloud environment with documented environment variables and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 387 Td (  operational troubleshooting steps.) Tj ET
